{title: Maine Royaan}
{artist: Tanveer}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] Maine roya tujhe [E] dhund dhunde,        [F#m] Roya tha main
[D] Tu na milaa,        [A] Gehrisi in raaton mein
[E] soyaa naa tha main,        [F#m] Rota tha teri yaadon mein
[D] woh hi raat,        [A] Maine kabhi na socha tujhe
[E] Bus roya yuhi khud se,        [F#m] Yun dil ko
[D] Yun dil ko Sambhalta raha,        [A] Maine roya tujhe [E] dhund dhunde
[F#m] Roya tha main,        [D] Tu na milaa
